      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The aim of this article is to focus on the fixed-dose combination of phentermine and topiramate, a new antiobesity drug recently approved by the US FDA. The mechanisms of weight loss for each drug in monotherapy is described, followed by the rationale for its use as a combination therapy and a comprehensive review of recently published clinical trials that assessed its efficacy  and safety."},
